  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop celery and brown onion (see ingredients).\n• Drain and rinse lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa068c80ad488c9bcf693/step-97851100.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook celery and onion, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic & herb seasoning and garlic paste, then cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa068c80ad488c9bcf693/step-2ad95810.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium, then add tomato sugo, red wine jus, stock concentrate, lentils, the butter, brown sugar and a splash of water and cook until thickened, 4-6 minutes. Season with a pinch of pepper.\n• Meanwhile, heat a small saucepan over medium heat. Heat light cooking cream until starting to steam, 2-4 minutes.\n• Add half the Parmesan cheese and whisk until combined and smooth.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa068c80ad488c9bcf693/step-795fe120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice lasagne sheets in half widthways.\n• Spoon roughly 1/4 of the lentil filling into a baking dish, followed by 1/4 of bechamel and a sprinkle of grated mozzarella, then top with a lasagne sheet. Repeat with remaining filling, bechamel, mozzarella and lasagne sheets.\n• Finish with a final lasagne sheet, then remaining bechamel.\n• Bake lasagne until filling is bubbling and top is golden brown, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa068c80ad488c9bcf693/step-1dc33d30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the lasagne has 5 minutes remaining, roughly chop cucumber.\n• In a large bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, cucumber and balsamic vinaigrette dressing (see ingredients). Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa068c80ad488c9bcf693/step-85954a40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide lentil ragu and red wine jus lasagne between plates. Serve with cucumber salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa068c80ad488c9bcf693/step-26757650.jpg"
    }
  ]
